<slide>
  text-size: 3.8vmin
</slide>

<h2>Tips</h2>

<ul>
  <li>keep frames <b>small and incremental</b>: one idea per step gives the cleanest motion</li>
  <li>copy the previous frame and edit it; unrelated reformatting looks like noise</li>
  <li>the animation needs the <i>same language</i> in consecutive blocks; a language change cross-fades instead</li>
  <li>use <c>size=</c> when you want exact font sizes, <c>.left</c>/<c>.right</c> to align code beside text</li>
  <li>every feature is plain files: put decks in git, build them in CI</li>
</ul>

<notes>
  Add matcher regression cases to tests/fixtures when a transition looks wrong.
</notes>
